### Handed on to Social and Emotional Learning, Grades 9 to 12

Each grade 8 owner row hands on to the grade 9 row of its sub-skill, which assumes it. The grade 9 units below are those of the grades 9 to 12 frame (docs/courses/social-and-emotional-learning-grades-9-to-12/frame.md, "Picked up from Social and Emotional Learning, Grades 6 to 8"), whose table names these same grade 8 rows by their grade 8 unit (this frame's units 13 to 18).

