| Grade 8 mid-year check (session 31, school day 78, week 16; respond session 32, school day 80, week 16) | 15 | 1 | 1 | Unit 15's end-of-unit assessment: feelings named as the strength rises, a coping plan with costs, focus held through the hard part with a try-again plan (AASL.V.D.1 look-for), practice planned with rest (AASL.V.D.2 look-for), a week cut to fit. Samples units 13 and 14 on new cases: the choice judged afterward, the evidence that decides against the popular view, the value and its price, the exit plan. Forms: one written scenario page and one watched rehearsal per pair. |
