, the I-statement frame, the problem size meter, the negotiation frame. Curio Class writes the cases and page. Provisional cost for 30: about $8 printing. | After unit 16 because a fair deal starts from a view summed up so the other side agrees. Health unit 24 (negotiating a compromise, weeks 9 to 12) comes first; this unit's deal where both sides pay builds on it. Two groups and 10 sessions. Sessions 44 to 53 of the year, weeks 22 to 27. | Candidate: the friend's-secret case checked that the secret is a worry routed to an adult, never a health detail | A friend's worrying secret is sized "big" and routed to a trusted adult; no case details self-harm, substances or abuse, which health owns. No student names a real friend or limit. Disclosure: health's steps. Agent reads: sensitivity. |
