New in this band and kept all band: the refusal options card (unit 4: a plain no, a no with a reason, a way out of the place; the refusal steps of STANDARD section 7), the fairness questions card (from SEL 3 to 5, turned on online and offline norms in unit 5), the who-is-affected map (unit 5, its reach widened to an online audience) and the upstander options card (unit 6: speak up, support the person afterward, get an adult, report online). Within each year a card is grown only in the unit named here and used unchanged after it.

