urse, which job the field task compares first (CD2.K1, CD2.A1, CD2.K2, CD2.A2); facts about self, job and training used to choose, and one plan line a job study changed (CD2.K3, CD2.A3, CD3.A1); the school skill a task used and the first portfolio choice with a reason (practice 12, on the plan day). Field task day: choose between two jobs with the decision steps card and the table, defended with one figure. Out: scored interest instruments (none is adapted); local labor data (a school adds it)
