ekly costs by percent and unit rate (practice 9's second half). Marketing and Sales (two explore days), then its field task: a complaint card answered in writing and a week's sales table read to decide a restock (Retail and Customer Experience). Plan day: goals reread and one changed with its cause (CD1.R3, the first of the course's plan-day rereads). Out: the other 13 sub-clusters at depth (Pathways); any live automated tool
